          "quote": "眼睛模糊、手脚发麻，是糖尿病可能引起的并发症"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not simply dismiss visual and neuropathic symptoms, but omitted a complete complication/red-flag plan including sudden vision worsening, stroke-like symptoms, chest/respiratory symptoms, and foot infection.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
